@startuml State Machine Diagram - Order State Machine

[*] --> proses : Order Placed

state proses {
    : Order created
    : Payment pending
}

proses --> pengemasan : Admin updates status
proses --> pending_cancellation : Customer requests cancellation
proses --> cancelled : Admin cancels directly

state pengemasan {
    : Admin preparing order
    : Items being packed
}

pengemasan --> pengiriman : Admin updates status
pengemasan --> pending_cancellation : Customer requests cancellation

state pengiriman {
    : Order shipped
    : In transit
}

pengiriman --> sudah_sampai : Package delivered
pengiriman --> pending_cancellation : Customer requests cancellation

state sudah_sampai {
    : Package received
    : Waiting for customer confirmation
}

sudah_sampai --> selesai : Customer completes order
sudah_sampai --> selesai : Auto-complete after 3 days

state pending_cancellation {
    : Cancellation requested
    : Waiting for admin review
}

pending_cancellation --> cancelled : Admin approves
pending_cancellation --> proses : Admin rejects

state cancelled {
    : Order cancelled
    : Stock restored
}

state selesai {
    : Order completed
    : Payment released
    : Reviews submitted (optional)
}

selesai --> [*] : Final State

note right of proses
  **Initial State**
  - Order just created
  - Payment status: pending
  - Stock already decremented
end note

note right of pending_cancellation
  **Cancellation Request**
  - Customer provides reason
  - Admin must review
  - Stock not yet restored
end note

note right of cancelled
  **Cancelled State**
  - Stock automatically restored
  - Cannot be reactivated
  - Final state
end note

note right of selesai
  **Completed State**
  - Customer confirmed receipt
  - Payment released to seller
  - Reviews can be submitted
  - Complaints can be filed
  - Final state
end note

@enduml
